1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,400
Taipei's got Brother Feng, let's go, don't run away!
台北有鋒兄，嗨起來，別逃跑！

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:11,280
From top exam ace to mayor, what a crazy play! (Wow!)
從考試榜首到市長，多麼瘋狂的演出！（哇！）

3
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:15,660
Brother Tu, sing it loud, don't hide your shining glow!
塗哥，大聲唱，別藏起你的光芒！

4
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:20,260
Cameras flashing everywhere, it's an S-tier anime show!
相機閃光燈四處亮起，這是 S 級動畫秀！

5
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:23,160
(Thirty-seven!) I topped the national exam! (Yeah!)
（三十七歲！）我考上國家考試榜首！（耶！）

6
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:25,780
Information tech champion, now you know just who I am!
資訊科技冠軍，現在你知道我是誰！

7
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:28,400
Across the screens of time, my dreams became the code! (Run!)
穿越時代的螢幕，我的夢想化為程式！（跑！）

8
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:30,680
(Fifty-two!) Deputy mayor, taking charge along the road! (Yo!)
（五十二歲！）副市長上陣，一路掌舵！（喲！）

9
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:33,600
Brother Tu, sing, “It's great to have Brother Feng!”
塗哥，唱吧：「有鋒兄真好！」

10
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:36,220
From waiting list to number one, hear the victory ring!
從備取到第一名，聽見勝利響起！

11
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:38,440
Don't sing? Your chance gets canceled! (Ha!)
不唱？你的機會就取消！（哈！）

12
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:41,740
Evolution runs on signals, not on lucky stars!
進化靠訊號，不靠幸運星！

13
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:46,640
Taipei's got Brother Feng, let's go, don't run away!
台北有鋒兄，嗨起來，別逃跑！

14
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:51,920
From exam king to city hall, debugging fate all day!
從考場王者到市政府，整天為命運除錯！

15
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:56,440
Brother Tu, turn up the volume, make the whole crowd shout!
塗哥，音量開大，讓全場吶喊！

16
00:00:57,020 --> 00:01:02,900
Acting mayor's just a chapter, the city's dreaming loud!
代理市長只是篇章，整座城大聲追夢！

17
00:01:04,720 --> 00:01:09,440
(Twenty-forty!) Neon nights, the city hall's alive!
（二零四零！）霓虹之夜，市政府充滿活力！

18
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:11,880
Campaign slogans like an ACG opening come to life!
競選標語像 ACG 片頭，鮮活登場！

19
00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:14,460
Don't say impossible, Brother Feng's evolution!
別說不可能，這是鋒兄的進化！

20
00:01:14,460 --> 00:01:17,480
(AI!) Smart government, open-data revolution!
（AI！）智慧政務，開放資料的革命！

21
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:20,000
Yin and yang together, politics and dreams collide!
陰陽同框，政治與夢想碰撞！

22
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,540
On this crossing stage, we're standing side by side!
在這交錯舞台，我們並肩站立！

23
00:01:22,540 --> 00:01:24,960
Sing so loud, the ballots start to dance tonight!
大聲唱，讓選票今晚都跳起來！

24
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:27,000
Brother Tu — sing it one more time!
塗哥——再唱一次！

25
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:32,880
Taipei's got Brother Feng, party till the morning light!
台北有鋒兄，狂歡直到天亮！

26
00:01:32,880 --> 00:01:37,240
From exam ace to mayor, evolution takes its flight!
從考試榜首到市長，進化展翅飛翔！

27
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:42,780
Even the elite agree, this transformation's right!
連菁英都同意，這場轉變恰如其分！

28
00:01:42,780 --> 00:01:46,260
Yes, yes, evolution!
對，對，就是進化！

29
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:51,100
No — this is Brother Feng's Evolution Show! 🔥
不——這是鋒兄進化秀！🔥
